OL,3,GNEWSAWhen are Bradford's Christmas
OL,4,Alight switch-ons taking place?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs festivities gear up ahead of
OL,7,FChristmas, Bradford is set to play host
OL,8,Fto a variety of events.
OL,10,FFrom Pixie Lott and Punjabi Roots to
OL,11,FChristmas Markets and K-pop, the
OL,12,Fdistrict will be awash with
OL,13,Fentertainment to help ramp up the
OL,14,Fexcitement.
OL,16,FStarting this weekend, Christmas lights
OL,17,Fswitch-on events are taking place
OL,18,Fthroughout November and December.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
