OL,3,GNEWSAWhen are Bradford's Christmas
OL,4,Alight switch-ons taking place?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEncouraging residents to join in,
OL,7,FBradford Council's executive member for
OL,8,Fcommunities and neighbourhoods Ian
OL,9,FWalker said: "Christmas lights
OL,10,Fswitch-on events are a much-loved part
OL,11,Fof the festive season and a great way
OL,12,Ffor people to come together and
OL,13,Fcelebrate with family, friends and
OL,14,Fneighbours.
